VALUES ('Marisol Nichols', 'Marisol Nichols', 'marisol-nichols', 'Female', 'Acting', '1973-11-02', NULL, 'Chicago, Illinois, USA', 'Marisol Nichols (born November 2, 1973) is an American actress. She is widely recognized for her starring role as Hermione Lodge in The CW\'s smash-hit teen mystery drama series Riverdale (2017–2023). She also portrayed CTU Special Agent Nadia Yassir in Fox\'s critically acclaimed thriller series 24 (Season 6) and starred in films such as Vegas Vacation (1997), Scream 2, The Princess and the Marine (ALMA Award nomination), Big Momma\'s House 2, and the horror thriller Spiral (2021) alongside Chris Rock and Samuel L. Jackson.', 'people/photos/marisol-nichols.jpg', 'https://www.instagram.com/marisolnichols', '{\"instagram\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/marisolnichols\",\"twitter\":\"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/marisolnichols\",\"imdb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.imdb.com\\/name\\/nm0629653\\/\"}', 1, 'active', 1, @now, @now)
