VALUES ('Dolph Lundgren', 'Dolph Lundgren', 'dolph-lundgren', 'Male', 'Acting', '1957-11-03', NULL, 'Spånga, Stockholm, Sweden', 'Hans \"Dolph\" Lundgren (born 3 November 1957) is a Swedish actor, filmmaker, and martial artist. Holding a master\'s degree in chemical engineering and a 4th dan black belt in Kyokushin karate, Lundgren became an international action movie icon starring as the formidable Soviet boxer Ivan Drago opposite Sylvester Stallone in Rocky IV (1985). He went on to headline blockbuster action franchises including Masters of the Universe (He-Man), Universal Soldier, The Punisher, The Expendables series as Gunner Jensen, Creed II (2018), and DC\'s Aquaman (2018) as King Nereus.', 'people/photos/dolph-lundgren.jpg', 'https://www.instagram.com/dolphlundgren', '{\"instagram\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/dolphlundgren\",\"twitter\":\"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/Dolph_Lundgren\",\"imdb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.imdb.com\\/name\\/nm0000185\\/\"}', 1, 'active', 1, @now, @now)
