VALUES ('Sonali Kulkarni', 'Sonali Kulkarni', 'sonali-kulkarni', 'Female', 'Acting', '1974-11-03', NULL, 'Pune, Maharashtra, India', 'Sonali Kulkarni (born 3 November 1974) is an acclaimed Indian actress and writer who has worked in Hindi, Marathi, Gujarati, and Tamil cinema. A recipient of the National Film Award (Special Jury Mention) for the short film Chaitra, Kulkarni is celebrated for unforgettable performances in Farhan Akhtar\'s cult classic Dil Chahta Hai (2001) as Pooja, Vidhu Vinod Chopra\'s Mission Kashmir (2000), Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar, Singham (2011), Poster Boys, and the Marathi critical triumph Kaccha Limboo (2017).', 'people/photos/sonali-kulkarni.jpg', 'https://www.instagram.com/sonalikul', '{\"instagram\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/sonalikul\",\"twitter\":\"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/sonalikulkarni\",\"imdb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.imdb.com\\/name\\/nm0474613\\/\"}', 1, 'active', 1, @now, @now)
